			"notes": "## Backrooms Horror Mod 2.0\n\n### New Content\n- **100 levels** (0–99) — 70 new levels with unique floor materials, fog colors, and atmospheric lighting\n- Each level has its own distinct visual identity\n\n### New Mechanic — Escape the Backrooms\n- **/noclip is gone** — replaced with a real physical mechanic\n- Noclip through a wall (get your head inside a solid block) while in the Backrooms\n- You'll be blinded and pulled into **Hyperian (Level 29)** — the final level\n- Kill the **VoidWalker** guarding Hyperian to escape back to the overworld\n- Can only trigger once per session — no cheesing it\n\n### Bug Fixes & Upgrades\n- Fixed Amalgamation and CorruptedFaceling entity spawn mechanics (were silently broken)\n- Fixed InsanityEntity double-decrement cooldown bug\n- Upgraded LeviathanEntity: speed surge attack, massive knockback on hit, roar on aggro, slowness/darkness aura\n- SmilerEntity now lunges at full sprint when player looks away\n\nCompatible with Fabric, Forge, and NeoForge for Minecraft 1.20.1."
		},
